# Spring PetClinic - Cursor Rules Overview
# Version: 1.0 | Date: 2026-01-17

## Project Summary

This is a Spring Boot 3.2.1 REST API backend with a React 15.x TypeScript frontend.

| Component | Technology | Version |
|-----------|------------|---------|
| Backend Framework | Spring Boot | 3.2.1 |
| Language | Java | 17+ |
| Build Tool | Maven | 3.x |
| Frontend | React + TypeScript | 15.x / 4.9.x |
| Database | HSQLDB (default), MySQL, PostgreSQL | - |

---

## Rules Files Index

| File | Description | When to Use |
|------|-------------|-------------|
| `01-database.mdc` | Database schema, SQL scripts, migration | Adding tables, columns, indexes |
| `02-entity-jpa.mdc` | JPA entities, validation, relationships | Creating/modifying domain models |
| `03-repository.mdc` | Data access layer, Spring Data JPA | Adding repository methods |
| `04-service.mdc` | Service layer, transactions, business logic | Adding business operations |
| `05-controller-api.mdc` | REST controllers, OpenAPI, mappers | Adding API endpoints |
| `06-spring-framework.mdc` | Spring Boot config, profiles, DI | Configuration changes |
| `07-unit-testing.mdc` | Unit test conventions and patterns | Writing unit tests |
| `08-checklist.mdc` | New feature checklist, common mistakes | Adding new domain entities |
| `09-tdd-development.mdc` | Test-Driven Development workflow | New feature development |

