## Useful Commands

```bash
# Build project
./mvnw clean install        # Linux/Mac
.\mvnw.cmd clean install    # Windows

# Run application
./mvnw spring-boot:run

# Generate OpenAPI DTOs
./mvnw compile

# Run tests
./mvnw test
```
